{"articleNo":"2834","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2834&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-1학기 보강기간 등 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.05.23","hit":"14915","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">◆ 보강기간 등 안내 ◆</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">2011학년도 1학기 보강기간 및 기말시험 기간을 공지하오니, 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보강기간 : 2011. 6. 8(수) ― 6. 14(화)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒ ▪어</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"> 린 이 날 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 5. 5(목) → </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 8(수),&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▪석가탄신일 : 5.10(화) →</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 6.9(목) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▪현충일 : 6. 6(월) →</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 6.10(금)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▪</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">산</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">업시찰 등 단체 학생활동(2일) : → </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">6.13(월), 14(화)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 기말시험기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">2011. 6. 15(수)- 6. 21(화)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">※ 기타 학사 일정은 교육학사―학부안내-학사일정 참조</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
